:: FirstDeath_Choices {"position":"2875,125","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.clearTimedChoice && setup.clearTimedChoice()>>
<div class="choice-screen timed-choice-screen first-death-choice-screen black-stage urgent-choice-shake" data-timed-choice-seconds="5" data-timed-choice-target="FirstDeath_Timeout">
<div class="choice-prompt first-death-choice-prompt"><div class="urgent-shake-inner">기둥이 무너진다.
쿠로가 그 아래에 있다.</div></div>

<div class="global-choice-layer first-death-choice-layer">
  <div class="timed-choice-stack"><<nobr>>
    <div class="first-death-tension-ui timed-choice-bar-ui">
      <div class="first-death-tension-label">반응</div>
      <div class="first-death-tension-track first-death-tension-bar timed-choice-bar-track">
        <div class="first-death-tension-fill timed-choice-bar-fill" data-timed-choice-bar></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="urgent-shake-inner">
      <div class="global-choice-box first-death-choice-box" style="height:auto !important; min-height:0 !important; flex:0 0 auto !important;">
        <<link "쿠로를 밀쳐낸다">>
          <<run setup.clearTimedChoice && setup.clearTimedChoice()>>
          <<goto "FirstDeath_PushKuro">>
        <</link>>
        <<link "기둥을 벤다">>
          <<run setup.clearTimedChoice && setup.clearTimedChoice()>>
          <<goto "FirstDeath_CutPillar">>
        <</link>>
        <<link "몸으로 받는다">>
          <<run setup.clearTimedChoice && setup.clearTimedChoice()>>
          <<goto "FirstDeath_Block">>
        <</link>>
      </div>
    </div>
  <</nobr>>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
<</page>>

:: FirstDeath_Timeout {"position":"2875,225","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<run setup.clearTimedChoice && setup.clearTimedChoice()>>
<<set $danger = ($danger || 0) + 1>>
<<set $isolation = ($isolation || 0) + 1>>
<div class="narration-screen">
<div class="narration narration-block">늑대는 늦었다.

아니,
움직이지 못한 것은 아니었다.

몸은 명령을 기다렸다.
그 짧은 틈에,
기둥은 이미 무너지고 있었다.</div>
</div>

<<stateNotice "danger">>
<<stateNotice "isolation">>

<<continueTo "BadEnd_FirstDeath">>
<</page>>

